---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Copyright & DMCA — REBELVAULT"
  description="Copyright and third-party video information for REBELVAULT."
>

  <section class="legal-page">

    <div class="legal-inner">

      <div class="eyebrow">
        COPYRIGHT & THIRD-PARTY CONTENT
      </div>

      <h1>
        Copyright & DMCA
      </h1>

      <p class="lead">
        REBELVAULT is a movie discovery and directory platform. We do not
        host, upload, store, or distribute copies of third-party video files.
      </p>

      <div class="legal-section">

        <h2>Third-Party Video Content</h2>

        <p>
          Movies and videos displayed on REBELVAULT may be presented through
          third-party video platforms and embedded players. The underlying
          video content is hosted by the respective third-party platform,
          not by REBELVAULT.
        </p>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT does not claim ownership of third-party movies, videos,
          footage, music, images, trademarks, or other copyrighted material
          belonging to their respective owners.
        </p>

        <p>
          The appearance of a third-party video or movie listing on
          REBELVAULT does not mean that REBELVAULT owns, uploaded, licensed,
          or independently distributed that video.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="notice">

        <strong>
          IMPORTANT FOR COPYRIGHT OWNERS
        </strong>

        <p>
          If you believe that a video hosted on YouTube infringes your
          copyright, please submit your copyright complaint directly to
          YouTube, because YouTube is the platform hosting and controlling
          the original video.
        </p>

        <p>
          YouTube provides an official copyright removal process for
          copyright owners and authorized representatives.
        </p>

        <a
          href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/2807622"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="legal-link"
        >
          YouTube Copyright Removal Request →
        </a>

      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">

        <h2>Why YouTube Should Receive the Copyright Complaint</h2>

        <p>
          When a video is hosted on YouTube, the video itself remains on
          YouTube's platform and is controlled through YouTube's systems.
          Copyright owners can submit a copyright removal request directly
          to YouTube when they believe their copyrighted material has been
          uploaded without authorization.
        </p>

        <p>
          YouTube reviews copyright removal requests and may remove content
          when a request satisfies its applicable requirements.
        </p>

        <p>
          For this reason, copyright owners should use YouTube's official
          copyright reporting and removal procedures for the original
          YouTube video.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">

        <h2>Embedded Players</h2>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT may display videos using embedded third-party players.
          An embedded player is not the same as REBELVAULT hosting or
          uploading the underlying video file.
        </p>

        <p>
          If a third-party platform removes a video, disables embedding,
          restricts access, or otherwise changes the availability of a
          video, the corresponding embedded content on REBELVAULT may also
          become unavailable.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">

        <h2>Copyright Ownership</h2>

        <p>
          All copyrights and other intellectual property rights in movies,
          videos, music, artwork, trademarks, characters, names, and other
          third-party materials remain with their respective owners.
        </p>

        <p>
          Nothing on REBELVAULT should be interpreted as a transfer of
          copyright ownership or as a claim by REBELVAULT that it owns
          third-party audiovisual content.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">

        <h2>False or Improper Copyright Claims</h2>

        <p>
          Copyright complaints should be submitted by the copyright owner
          or an authorized representative and should follow the applicable
          platform's official procedures.
        </p>

        <p>
          YouTube requires copyright removal requests to contain specific
          information and legal statements. Copyright owners should follow
          YouTube's current requirements when submitting a complaint.
        </p>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT does not determine copyright ownership disputes between
          third parties and does not represent itself as the copyright owner
          of third-party video content.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="legal-section">

        <h2>Removal of a Listing or Embed</h2>

        <p>
          If a copyright owner has successfully caused a third-party video
          to be removed or made unavailable on its hosting platform, the
          corresponding REBELVAULT listing or embedded player may naturally
          stop functioning.
        </p>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT may also remove or disable a corresponding listing or
          embedded reference when appropriate.
        </p>

        <p>
          Copyright owners should first use the copyright enforcement and
          removal mechanisms provided by the platform hosting the original
          video.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="notice secondary">

        <strong>
          YOUTUBE COPYRIGHT REPORTING
        </strong>

        <p>
          For videos hosted on YouTube, copyright owners can submit a
          copyright removal request through YouTube Studio or through
          YouTube's official copyright process.
        </p>

        <a
          href="https://support.google.com/youtube/answer/2807622"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="legal-link"
        >
          Report Copyright Infringement to YouTube →
        </a>

      </div>

      <div class="legal-footer">

        <p>
          This page is provided for informational purposes and does not
          constitute legal advice or create a guarantee of immunity from
          copyright claims, legal proceedings, or other liabilities.
        </p>

        <p>
          REBELVAULT reserves the right to modify, remove, or disable
          listings and third-party embeds at its discretion.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>

  <style>

    .legal-page {
      min-height: 80vh;
      padding: 90px 24px 120px;
    }

    .legal-inner {
      width: min(900px, 100%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #8f96a3;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 26px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: clamp(42px, 7vw, 76px);
      line-height: 0.95;
      letter-spacing: -3px;
    }

    .lead {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 0 55px;
      color: #b7bcc5;
      font-size: 19px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .legal-section {
      padding: 34px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .legal-section h2 {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 22px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }

    .legal-section p,
    .notice p,
    .legal-footer p {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      color: #9da3ad;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.85;
    }

    .legal-section p:last-child,
    .notice p:last-child,
    .legal-footer p:last-child {
      margin-bottom: 0;
    }

    .notice {
      margin: 18px 0 25px;
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 12px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.035);
    }

    .notice strong {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 1.5px;
    }

    .notice.secondary {
      margin-top: 38px;
    }

    .legal-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      margin-top: 8px;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    }

    .legal-link:hover {
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .legal-footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      padding-top: 30px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }

    .legal-footer p {
      color: #6f7580;
      font-size: 12px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 620px) {

      .legal-page {
        padding: 65px 18px 80px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 46px;
        letter-spacing: -2px;
      }

      .lead {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .legal-section {
        padding: 28px 0;
      }

      .notice {
        padding: 22px;
      }

    }

  </style>

</Layout>
